  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development, by virtue of layout, restricted head height and poor quality outlook, light and ventilation to bedroom 7, would represent a substandard and inappropriate form of accommodation which would not be capable of meeting the reasonable needs of occupiers and would be detrimental to the residential amenities of future occupants. The proposal is thereby contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policies D3, D5 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP4 and CP5 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and DMD5, DMD6 and DMD8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
